  "notes": "Adds a new numbered Quick Colors panel to the tall left-edge editor tabs. It displays the complete Falling Angle palette as clickable swatches with names and hex codes, grouped into Original Falling Angle, Michael Grace, and Holy Gold / Light. Click a color field first and a swatch applies directly to it; otherwise the swatch copies its hex code. Keeps all prior tools and palettes."
